Exceptions 
● Exception parent object in std::exception 
– std::runtime_error 
– std::bad_alloc 
– std::bad_cast 
● Can create your own custom exceptions 
class MyException : public exception{ 
const char * what() const { 
return "MyException"; // human-readable 
} 
}; 
