Functions Throwing 
● Functions add throw(exceptions-thrown) at end 
of declaration. 
void ahh(int i) throw() { 
//This function assumed to not throw anything 
} 
void blahh(int i) throw(int) { 
//This function may throw int if there's an error 
} 
